  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n4x ÷ (0.75² − 0.25²) = 0.5\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\na² − b² = (a − b) × (a + b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 0.75² − 0.25² = (0.75 − 0.25) × (0.75 + 0.25)\n\n⇒ = 0.5 × 1 = 0.5\n\n⇒ 4x ÷ 0.5 = 0.5\n\n⇒ 4x = 0.5 × 0.5\n\n⇒ 4x = 0.25\n\n⇒ x = 0.25 ÷ 4\n\n⇒ x = 0.0625\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 0.0625.**",
